        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Pull a Still from a Clip\n\nGrabs one frame from a video at a chosen time. Use it to get a thumbnail or a reference still from existing footage.\n\n**How it works:** The \"Clip\" input goes to \"Grab a frame\", which extracts the frame at 2 seconds. \"Still\" shows the image. It runs locally through ffmpeg with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Set time on \"Grab a frame\" to the moment you want, such as 12.5 for a frame twelve and a half seconds in."
        },
